    "sentence_translations": [
      "Have You Thought It Through?",
      "",
      "For today's company dinner, the manager told everyone that they can bring along their boyfriend or husband.",
      "",
      "Little Zhang asked in a small voice: “Can I bring someone else's husband?”",
      "",
      "Her colleagues were all stunned.",
      "",
      "The manager said:",
      "“Normally the company doesn't meddle in your private business, but I have to ask: Have you thought this through?”",
      "",
      "Little Zhang said: “I've thought it through. It's just this once.”",
      "",
      "She then picked up her phone and said: “Dad, I know mom is not at home, but don't cook anything.”",
      "“Today our company has a dinner. Come eat with us!”"
